
Loop ka matlab:
ek kaam ko bar-bar repeat karna jab tak condition true ho.
C++ me 3 main loops hoti hain:
for loop
while loop
do-while loop


For Loop

For loop tab use hoti hai jab:
Tumhein pehle se pata ho
Kitni dafa kaam repeat karna hai.


While Loop

While loop tab use hoti hai jab:
Tumhein exact count nahi pata
Sirf itna pata ho ke
"jab tak condition true hai, tab tak kaam chalta rahe

While loop ka rule:

Pehle condition check hoti hai
Phir kaam hota hai

Agar condition false ho:
→ Loop ek bar bhi nahi chalegi.


Do-While Loop

Do-While loop thori different hoti hai:

Rule:
Pehle kaam hota hai
Phir condition check hoti hai

Iska matlab:
      Ye loop kam az kam 1 dafa zaroor chalegi
      Chahe condition false hi kyu na ho


    For Loop → fixed times ke liye
         While Loop → jab tak condition true ho
             Do-While Loop → kam az kam 1 dafa































